  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Walk the talk: Driving social accountability to accelerate implementation of the SDG&#x2019;s</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a way of engaging and promoting CAFOD&#x2019;s commitment to Pope Francis, Laudato-Si (139) that calls for an integrated approach  to combating, poverty, restoring dignity to the excluded  and to protecting nature, this work  fulfils part of the blueprints to  realising Pope Francis vision and lays the foundation for CAFOD&#x2019;s development priorities. While the SDG&#x2019;s agenda deals with a wide range of issues and  implementation challenges, CAFOD&#x2019;s Agenda T-2020 Action is endearing  to look at ways these broad but all highly important  goals are incorporated within national frameworks and how the  embolden hope that promises  &#x201c;leave no &#x2013;one behind&#x201d; can be universally acheived.  The project  will focus on supporting CAFOD partner  -National Caritas  to engage with CSOs at national level  to influence governments for the effective implementation and monitoring of the SDGs.</narrative>
  </description>
